@startuml
title SA-F01 — Identity and persistent cart
caption Owned data access across devices | PRD-01–03
actor Customer as C
participant Identity as I
participant "Verification channel" as V
participant Cart as T
C -> I : Start sign-in with phone
I -> V : Send challenge
C -> I : Verify challenge
alt Valid and unused
 I --> C : Establish account session
 C -> T : Read or change own cart on this device
 T -> I : Verify owner scope
 alt Own account
  T --> C : Same account cart
 else Foreign account
  T --> C : Deny without disclosing cart
 end
else Invalid or expired challenge
 I --> C : Deny and allow safe recovery
end
opt One confirmed order
 T -> T : Consume purchased quantities once
end
@enduml
